                  <msItem>
                     <title>Polychronicon</title>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Accordig to Leland 'Lowe episcopus à
                        fundamentis construxit [bibliothecam] et libris ornavit.' (Collectanea 4.
                        54). Notes by Lowe, by the antiquary John Bale (1495-1563), and, later, by
                        an Irishman.</note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">Foliation 1r--183r in Bale's hand. </note>
                     <note type="MLGB3_generalNotes">No doubt this manuscript is the source of
                        Bale's information about Lowe, Scriptores, p. 576.</note>
                  </msItem>
               </msContents>
